# Spiteful Hexmage: "When this creature enters, create a Cursed Role token attached to target creature you control." Both players
# have an Ornithopter (0/2); Bot1 casts the Hexmage on turn 3. Bot2's Ornithopter is refused as a target; Bot1's own Ornithopter is
# chosen and becomes 1/1 (CR 303.7: the Cursed Role makes it a 1/1), while the Hexmage stays 3/2 and Bot2's Ornithopter stays 0/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Spiteful Hexmage
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spiteful Hexmage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Spiteful Hexmage.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Spiteful Hexmage.Toughness = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
